WEBVTT

01:33.290 --> 01:35.561
(Adapted from the web novel "Waiting for You in a City")

01:35.621 --> 01:37.921
(Fireworks of My Heart)

01:37.990 --> 01:40.891
(Episode 31)

01:41.031 --> 01:43.561
They don't care about the patient's life.

01:43.630 --> 01:44.361
Excuse me.

01:44.630 --> 01:45.630
Sir, ma'am.

01:45.831 --> 01:46.971
Come down first.

01:47.031 --> 01:47.831
If you need anything,

01:48.001 --> 01:48.770
let's talk in the meeting room.

01:48.841 --> 01:49.501
Okay?

01:49.570 --> 01:50.270
Ma'am.

01:50.341 --> 01:51.001
It's cold outside.

01:51.070 --> 01:51.740
Let's talk inside.

01:51.811 --> 01:52.471
No!

01:52.770 --> 01:54.171
What's there to talk about with you?

01:54.641 --> 01:55.581
My daughter-in-law...

01:55.880 --> 01:57.910
is a good person.

01:58.180 --> 01:59.410
She's filial...

01:59.481 --> 02:01.210
and capable.

02:01.951 --> 02:04.520
She died because of you!

02:05.550 --> 02:07.490
If you don't compensate us, we'll...

02:07.951 --> 02:09.290
There's nothing to talk about.

02:09.460 --> 02:10.591
Compensate us!

02:10.820 --> 02:12.630
If you want to talk, let's talk here.

02:13.061 --> 02:13.731
Tell us.

02:14.061 --> 02:14.900
Are you going to compensate us or not?

02:15.160 --> 02:15.831
Young man.

02:16.261 --> 02:17.631
This is a society governed by law.

02:17.731 --> 02:19.071
We need to be reasonable, right?

02:19.231 --> 02:20.400
If you're really not satisfied,

02:20.470 --> 02:21.701
get a lawyer and take it to court.

02:21.870 --> 02:22.541
Right?

02:22.601 --> 02:23.370
Hire a lawyer?

02:23.571 --> 02:24.441
Go to court?

02:25.071 --> 02:26.171
That's easy for you to say.

02:26.470 --> 02:27.171
We have no money or power.

02:27.240 --> 02:27.911
Follow me closely.

02:27.970 --> 02:28.641
Be ready at any time.

02:29.141 --> 02:30.081
Let me tell you.

02:30.310 --> 02:31.381
You have to compensate us.

02:31.710 --> 02:32.381
Compensate us!

02:32.451 --> 02:33.911
Young man, come down first.

02:34.210 --> 02:35.050
If you're really dissatisfied,

02:35.520 --> 02:36.750
let's talk it out.

02:37.150 --> 02:38.421
Officer, look at this.

02:39.421 --> 02:40.321
Come down first.

02:40.391 --> 02:41.460
Let's talk it out, all right?

02:41.990 --> 02:42.761
No.

02:43.261 --> 02:44.191
Listen.

02:44.791 --> 02:45.791
I'm telling you now.

02:46.391 --> 02:47.391
Even if I die,

02:47.861 --> 02:49.131
what did your hospital do to kill someone?

02:49.201 --> 02:49.861
Come on.

02:49.930 --> 02:51.201
Let's find someone to be the judge down there.

02:51.261 --> 02:51.930
Officer.

02:52.000 --> 02:52.671
Don't come over!

02:53.300 --> 02:53.970
Calm down.

02:54.030 --> 02:55.941
Young man, don't be rash.

02:59.071 --> 03:00.710
I'm warning you one last time.

03:01.240 --> 03:02.280
If you don't settle this,

03:02.511 --> 03:03.310
I'll jump!

03:03.611 --> 03:06.550
- Don't jump! - Don't jump!

03:06.611 --> 03:07.750
Please don't jump.

03:07.810 --> 03:11.951
- Don't jump. - Come down.

03:13.120 --> 03:14.520
You won't jump.

03:17.791 --> 03:18.460
Xu Qin?

03:18.530 --> 03:19.361
What are you talking about?

03:19.791 --> 03:20.490
Let me tell you.

03:20.990 --> 03:21.661
If I die,

03:21.731 --> 03:23.430
your hospital will suffer too.

03:23.731 --> 03:24.400
It's none of your business.

03:24.460 --> 03:25.370
Xu Qin, go back now.

03:25.430 --> 03:26.101
Don't come near me.

03:26.400 --> 03:27.701
- Xu Qin. - Don't come over here!

03:28.701 --> 03:29.400
- Don't come near him. - Don't.

03:30.101 --> 03:30.970
Son.

03:36.911 --> 03:37.710
Stop looking.

03:37.780 --> 03:38.611
It's not a high floor.

03:38.680 --> 03:39.451
You won't die from the fall.

03:40.451 --> 03:41.111
At most,

03:41.180 --> 03:42.351
you'll break an arm or a leg.

03:43.020 --> 03:44.381
Maybe you'll get a high-level paralysis...

03:44.451 --> 03:45.550
and be bedridden for life.

03:47.191 --> 03:48.891
Are you even human?

03:48.990 --> 03:49.691
Your hospital...

03:49.761 --> 03:51.761
killed my daughter-in-law.

03:52.060 --> 03:53.391
You have to compensate us.

03:54.430 --> 03:55.560
- Compensate us! - Pay us!

03:55.800 --> 03:57.000
- Compensate us! - Pay!

03:57.060 --> 03:58.300
Come down first.

03:58.701 --> 04:00.631
Do you know why the hospital can't pay you?

04:00.831 --> 04:02.071
I don't care.

04:02.141 --> 04:02.800
Compensate us!

04:03.270 --> 04:04.101
If we pay you,

04:05.071 --> 04:06.511
it will become Dr. Yang's flaw.

04:07.111 --> 04:08.541
Dr. Yang studied medicine for 10 years...

04:08.840 --> 04:10.141
and did further studies here and there.

04:10.611 --> 04:12.481
She worked her way up to be where she is today.

04:13.611 --> 04:14.280
Indeed,

04:14.750 --> 04:16.620
doctors work to feed their families too.

04:17.180 --> 04:18.191
But there are doctors...

04:18.720 --> 04:19.691
who believe...

04:19.750 --> 04:20.851
in this profession.

04:21.250 --> 04:22.620
They do it to save lives.

04:23.020 --> 04:24.420
To break the boundaries of academia.

04:24.960 --> 04:26.261
They do it for the entire industry...

04:26.391 --> 04:28.201
or even to create miracles for mankind.

04:29.100 --> 04:30.230
They don't do this to be trampled on...

04:30.301 --> 04:31.730
by unreasonable people like you.

04:32.831 --> 04:33.871
Do you know how much schools,

04:34.071 --> 04:35.270
hospitals, and countries...

04:35.641 --> 04:36.600
need to spend...

04:36.670 --> 04:38.571
in order to cultivate such a great doctor?

04:39.340 --> 04:40.840
Why should her future...

04:40.910 --> 04:42.681
be wasted in the hands of people like you?

04:43.181 --> 04:45.110
You say we're being unreasonable.

04:45.381 --> 04:47.150
You have no proof!

04:47.350 --> 04:48.581
Whether you're being unreasonable or not,

04:48.980 --> 04:49.980
it will be judged by the public.

04:50.420 --> 04:51.551
What happened to your daughter-in-law...

04:51.821 --> 04:53.621
will also be explained to you.

04:54.790 --> 04:55.691
People who are living...

04:55.960 --> 04:57.220
don't have to be noble.

04:57.391 --> 04:58.691
We just need to be independent...

04:59.061 --> 05:00.491
and not burden society.

05:01.561 --> 05:02.631
But look at what's happening now.

05:02.701 --> 05:04.100
You're taking up so many public resources.

05:04.730 --> 05:05.970
Look at the firefighters and police officers...

05:06.030 --> 05:07.201
who are ready to save you.

05:07.871 --> 05:09.141
They didn't choose this profession...

05:09.371 --> 05:11.301
to get killed because of you either.

05:12.710 --> 05:13.741
As a man,

05:14.241 --> 05:15.610
you're irresponsible and incompetent.

05:16.181 --> 05:17.081
Your wife passed away...

05:17.141 --> 05:18.381
and you're even relying on her to extort money.

05:19.581 --> 05:20.681
What did you say?

05:21.480 --> 05:22.350
Someone like you...

05:22.821 --> 05:23.920
can't be considered a man.

05:24.321 --> 05:25.991
I'll kill you!

05:26.451 --> 05:27.220
Son.

05:28.691 --> 05:29.491
Stop him!

05:35.460 --> 05:36.460
Check their injuries.

05:37.600 --> 05:38.470
- I'm okay. - Yang Chi.

05:38.530 --> 05:39.670
I'm fine. Help her up.

05:44.540 --> 05:45.270
Come with me.

05:50.141 --> 05:50.941
Are you all right, Yang Chi?

05:51.511 --> 05:52.181
I'm fine.

05:57.751 --> 05:59.191
What were you doing earlier?

05:59.420 --> 06:00.451
That was too risky.

06:00.821 --> 06:01.520
I'm sorry.

06:02.761 --> 06:03.860
I didn't think that much.

06:06.831 --> 06:08.431
I know you had good intentions.

06:09.230 --> 06:10.460
But you're a medical staff.

06:10.730 --> 06:11.871
Weren't there firefighters?

06:11.931 --> 06:12.801
Why did you go forward?

06:14.201 --> 06:15.400
Nothing happened anyway.

06:15.470 --> 06:16.270
That's true.

06:16.501 --> 06:17.540
What if something did happen?

06:18.710 --> 06:19.371
Also,

06:19.770 --> 06:20.770
what if someone...

06:21.470 --> 06:22.241
with an ulterior motive...

06:22.311 --> 06:23.480
took a video of you and posted what you said online?

06:23.780 --> 06:24.881
You wouldn't be able to defend yourself.

06:27.581 --> 06:29.920
You're young and inexperienced.

06:29.980 --> 06:31.220
You're usually quite calm.

06:31.350 --> 06:33.220
How could you be so impulsive in this matter?

06:33.790 --> 06:34.650
If you want to punish me,

06:35.121 --> 06:36.020
go ahead.

06:39.660 --> 06:40.331
If I wanted to punish you,

06:40.391 --> 06:41.360
I would've already punished you.

06:45.931 --> 06:47.201
I hope this matter...

06:47.301 --> 06:48.670
doesn't become a big deal too.

06:50.701 --> 06:51.540
Just take this as a warning.

06:55.280 --> 06:56.011
You.

06:57.141 --> 06:58.311
Go back and drink some hot water.

06:58.381 --> 06:59.181
Wear more clothes.

07:00.951 --> 07:01.621
Go.

07:04.051 --> 07:04.720
Okay.

07:16.900 --> 07:18.801
My family found out what had happened that day.

07:20.030 --> 07:21.501
They want me to transfer jobs.

07:24.040 --> 07:24.701
Do you want that?

07:25.340 --> 07:26.071
I don't.

07:26.511 --> 07:27.670
But it's no use even if I don't want that.

07:28.780 --> 07:29.581
You said it yourself.

07:30.311 --> 07:31.381
In my condition,

07:32.350 --> 07:33.610
I've caused you a lot of trouble.

07:33.980 --> 07:35.751
Someone who has no value to the unit...

07:36.150 --> 07:37.020
isn't worth losing.

07:37.520 --> 07:38.181
Says who?

07:38.251 --> 07:39.191
Says you.

07:39.251 --> 07:40.920
(Party loyalty, strict discipline, defy danger and death)

07:40.991 --> 07:43.220
You said I can't work at the front line.

07:44.290 --> 07:45.230
That was before.

07:45.590 --> 07:46.431
What about now?

07:49.931 --> 07:50.860
If you want to leave,

07:50.931 --> 07:51.730
you can.

07:52.270 --> 07:53.331
But if you don't want to leave,

07:55.141 --> 07:55.801
then don't.

07:57.241 --> 07:58.470
No, if I don't leave,

07:58.540 --> 08:00.141
I have to give my family a reason.

08:01.241 --> 08:01.941
That's easy.

08:02.811 --> 08:03.581
Shilitai needs you.

08:05.181 --> 08:06.081
That's not a reason.

08:06.150 --> 08:07.350
Why don't you get a new instructor?

08:07.410 --> 08:08.681
He might be more worthy...

08:08.751 --> 08:09.720
and do better than me.

08:11.621 --> 08:12.850
I need you too.

08:16.061 --> 08:16.821
Okay?

08:17.491 --> 08:18.831
You've been beating around the bush.

08:18.991 --> 08:20.160
Isn't that what you were waiting to hear?

08:20.230 --> 08:21.290
You already know,

08:21.360 --> 08:23.201
then say it more.

08:23.701 --> 08:24.460
What did you just say?

08:26.131 --> 08:26.801
Come on.

08:28.501 --> 08:29.371
Let's go.

08:32.710 --> 08:34.710
Do you need me or does Shilitai need me?

08:35.410 --> 08:36.280
Neither.

08:37.381 --> 08:38.081
Make yourself clear.

08:38.410 --> 08:39.681
Or I'll get a new job.

08:40.710 --> 08:41.380
Song Yan.

08:41.451 --> 08:46.120
(Serve Yancheng, very disciplined, wise and brave in fighting)

08:54.630 --> 08:55.460
Qin Qin.

08:55.531 --> 08:56.201
Is that her?

08:56.260 --> 08:57.000
It's Qin Qin.

08:57.301 --> 08:58.000
Qin Qin.

08:58.431 --> 08:59.100
You're back.

08:59.630 --> 09:00.331
Uncle, Aunt.

09:00.630 --> 09:01.531
Why are you here?

09:02.100 --> 09:03.571
Aren't you on the night shift?

09:03.740 --> 09:04.470
Look at this alley.

09:04.541 --> 09:05.370
All the shops are closed.

09:05.441 --> 09:06.110
It's so dark.

09:06.240 --> 09:07.840
We were afraid you'd be afraid to walk alone.

09:07.970 --> 09:08.840
And Yan Yan is in the unit.

09:08.911 --> 09:10.480
So I asked your uncle to pick you up.

09:11.340 --> 09:12.010
By the way,

09:12.250 --> 09:14.151
I bought you your favorite shrimp dumplings.

09:14.210 --> 09:15.220
See if this is it.

09:16.980 --> 09:17.651
Yes.

09:17.720 --> 09:18.620
Thank you, Uncle, Aunt.

09:18.951 --> 09:20.151
You must be hungry.

09:20.321 --> 09:21.791
I'll cook dumplings for you when we get home.

09:22.321 --> 09:22.990
Let's go.

09:23.220 --> 09:23.890
Come on.

09:25.590 --> 09:26.791
Why is your hand so cold?

09:26.860 --> 09:28.291
Hurry. Warm it in my pocket.

09:28.531 --> 09:29.831
These dumplings are really good.

09:30.331 --> 09:31.301
Let's eat dumplings at home.

09:31.701 --> 09:32.470
Cook more.

09:32.531 --> 09:33.431
- Okay. - Let's eat them together.

09:35.271 --> 09:35.970
Qin Qin.

09:36.171 --> 09:37.370
You must eat more.

09:37.771 --> 09:39.340
- Okay. - Look, you're so skinny.

09:39.571 --> 09:40.271
You have to eat more...

09:40.340 --> 09:41.510
to be healthy,

09:41.571 --> 09:42.740
so you can work better.

09:42.911 --> 09:43.581
Okay.

09:45.311 --> 09:46.781
Song Yan is the same.

09:46.911 --> 09:47.610
He's always working.

09:47.681 --> 09:48.350
His hours aren't set.

09:48.480 --> 09:49.281
There's no regularity.

09:49.350 --> 09:50.250
He's skinny too.

10:00.860 --> 10:01.561
Qin Qin.

10:02.360 --> 10:03.061
Did something...

10:03.401 --> 10:05.061
happen today?

10:08.000 --> 10:09.671
I saw Song Yan today.

10:10.941 --> 10:12.240
They were on a mission yesterday...

10:12.311 --> 10:13.441
and there was an explosion.

10:14.671 --> 10:15.411
Then what happened?

10:15.480 --> 10:16.380
Is he okay?

10:16.980 --> 10:18.281
Luckily, he's fine.

10:19.750 --> 10:20.850
Then what about the others?

10:20.911 --> 10:21.610
Are they all right?

10:21.681 --> 10:22.480
They're fine.

10:24.051 --> 10:24.781
That scared me.

10:28.151 --> 10:29.990
I'm still scared just thinking about it.

10:30.990 --> 10:31.960
What if...

10:34.431 --> 10:35.130
Qin Qin.

10:36.460 --> 10:37.301
Don't be scared.

10:38.061 --> 10:38.801
It's okay.

10:38.870 --> 10:40.831
Song Yan knows what he's doing.

10:41.130 --> 10:42.600
He knows how to protect himself.

10:42.840 --> 10:45.071
He also knows how to protect his subordinates.

10:47.441 --> 10:48.681
Actually, all these years,

10:48.980 --> 10:49.911
your uncle and I...

10:49.980 --> 10:51.041
have tried to persuade him...

10:51.110 --> 10:52.311
to change his job.

10:52.710 --> 10:55.480
But he just can't bear to part with his subordinates.

10:55.980 --> 10:56.720
Let me tell you.

10:56.781 --> 10:57.850
Their team...

10:57.921 --> 10:59.590
is the most well-rounded and well-disciplined...

10:59.651 --> 11:00.750
in this area.

11:00.921 --> 11:02.760
They never had any major accidents.

11:02.860 --> 11:04.561
It's all thanks to his good training.

11:08.260 --> 11:10.230
Why did he choose this profession?

11:13.201 --> 11:14.470
Well, he...

11:14.730 --> 11:16.140
joined the army at first.

11:17.500 --> 11:18.340
He also did a good job.

11:19.140 --> 11:20.610
Because of a lot of reasons,

11:20.671 --> 11:21.510
he didn't get promoted.

11:21.640 --> 11:23.781
Later on, he took the initiative to become a firefighter.

11:26.911 --> 11:27.811
And Qin Qin,

11:28.581 --> 11:30.321
you know Song Yan...

11:30.380 --> 11:32.090
was abandoned when he was young.

11:32.151 --> 11:33.720
He really wants to have a family.

11:33.791 --> 11:35.590
He just wants to spoil his family...

11:35.661 --> 11:36.720
and his beloved.

11:36.791 --> 11:38.191
That's the kind of person he is.

11:38.390 --> 11:39.061
Yes.

11:39.860 --> 11:40.531
And...

11:40.590 --> 11:41.260
Don't.

11:41.331 --> 11:42.031
You know what? Look.

11:42.301 --> 11:43.031
I think Qin Qin...

11:43.500 --> 11:45.130
is also tired from work.

11:45.431 --> 11:46.401
If you don't want to eat,

11:46.470 --> 11:47.470
go and get some rest.

11:47.531 --> 11:48.201
Okay?

11:51.441 --> 11:52.210
Then...

11:52.311 --> 11:53.870
Aunt, Uncle, I'll go ahead.

11:53.941 --> 11:54.610
Okay.

12:07.120 --> 12:07.921
Something...

12:08.421 --> 12:09.661
is troubling this kid.

12:11.021 --> 12:11.691
It involves the two of them.

12:11.760 --> 12:12.960
They can solve it themselves.

12:13.031 --> 12:14.191
Why are you worried?

12:14.260 --> 12:16.130
How can I not be worried?

12:16.201 --> 12:17.831
What if they break up again? What should we do?

12:17.901 --> 12:19.271
What if she abandons him...

12:19.331 --> 12:20.500
like his own mom?

12:20.931 --> 12:22.541
What kind of comparison is that?

12:22.600 --> 12:23.500
I told you not to mention that woman.

12:23.571 --> 12:24.701
You're talking about her again.

12:25.071 --> 12:25.740
This is your punishment.

12:25.911 --> 12:26.911
Make breakfast tomorrow morning.

12:27.140 --> 12:27.911
I'll sleep in.

12:28.171 --> 12:29.281
Eat this. Don't waste it.

12:34.081 --> 12:36.620
As if you ever made breakfast.

14:25.260 --> 14:26.390
Mom.

14:38.301 --> 14:39.311
Mom!

14:49.380 --> 14:50.181
Mom.

14:51.151 --> 14:51.921
Mom.

14:53.921 --> 14:54.590
Qin Qin.

14:54.651 --> 14:55.321
Mom.

14:55.390 --> 14:56.061
Qin Qin.

14:57.090 --> 14:57.990
Dad.

14:59.791 --> 15:00.460
Qin Qin.

15:02.130 --> 15:03.031
Qin Qin.

15:04.000 --> 15:04.730
Mom.

15:05.260 --> 15:07.100
- What are you doing? - Qin Qin.

15:07.331 --> 15:09.441
Why are you doing this?

15:09.901 --> 15:11.370
I'm sorry.

15:11.441 --> 15:13.640
I don't want you to be sorry.

15:15.071 --> 15:16.311
Mom!

15:35.730 --> 15:36.831
- Chief, we're going home. - We'll go ahead.

15:37.000 --> 15:37.760
- Get some rest. - You too.

15:37.831 --> 15:39.000
- We'll get going. - We're going home.

15:39.071 --> 15:39.970
Be careful.

16:09.230 --> 16:11.630
(Song Yan)

16:12.901 --> 16:13.701
Hello?

16:14.130 --> 16:14.801
Hello?

16:15.301 --> 16:16.140
I just got back to the station.

16:16.771 --> 16:17.740
Did you call me?

16:21.271 --> 16:22.380
I had a nightmare.

16:25.110 --> 16:25.781
What happened?

16:27.510 --> 16:28.380
There was an explosion.

16:29.120 --> 16:30.181
You died.

16:37.390 --> 16:38.220
Silly girl.

16:39.090 --> 16:40.161
I'll be fine.

16:41.590 --> 16:42.401
Have you forgotten?

16:43.031 --> 16:44.230
I haven't recovered yet.

16:44.860 --> 16:45.671
I won't use my strength.

16:45.901 --> 16:46.701
I won't go into fires.

16:55.140 --> 16:55.980
You can work with ease.

16:58.411 --> 16:59.411
I'll be back this week.

17:00.110 --> 17:00.880
I'll spend the weekend with you.

17:01.781 --> 17:02.620
This time,

17:02.681 --> 17:03.850
you have two days off, don't you?

17:04.521 --> 17:05.220
Yes.

17:05.720 --> 17:06.421
Two days.

17:08.390 --> 17:10.691
I've already talked to them about switching shifts in advance.

17:12.291 --> 17:12.961
This way,

17:13.491 --> 17:15.390
I can clear my schedule on the weekend.

17:18.331 --> 17:19.600
Don't think too much.

17:20.301 --> 17:21.001
Go to bed.

17:22.971 --> 17:23.640
By the way,

17:24.870 --> 17:25.541
tomorrow,

17:26.471 --> 17:27.471
take a taxi to work.

17:27.910 --> 17:29.110
Don't take the subway.

17:29.711 --> 17:30.880
It's crowded during rush hour.

17:31.380 --> 17:32.110
People are indiscreet.

17:32.380 --> 17:33.081
You'll get hurt.

17:33.711 --> 17:34.581
Song Yan.

17:39.390 --> 17:40.791
I miss you.

17:44.360 --> 17:45.221
I miss you too.

17:47.831 --> 17:48.690
So much.

17:53.130 --> 17:53.831
Go to sleep.

17:55.870 --> 17:56.541
Good night.

17:57.170 --> 17:57.870
Good night.

18:21.890 --> 18:22.660
Jiang Yu!

18:22.731 --> 18:24.001
(We'll go when there's a report, we'll move once we hear about it)

18:24.061 --> 18:24.731
Jiang Yu, wake up.

18:25.430 --> 18:26.100
Jiang Yu!

18:26.200 --> 18:26.930
Wake up!

18:30.370 --> 18:31.100
Jiang Yu!

18:32.471 --> 18:33.541
Jiang Yu, wake up.

18:33.910 --> 18:34.571
Jiang Yu!

18:34.670 --> 18:35.340
Wake up!

18:41.150 --> 18:42.821
Let me see. Are you hurt?

18:43.521 --> 18:44.180
Are you hurt?

18:44.350 --> 18:45.180
I'm fine.

18:53.930 --> 18:54.590
Stop gathering around.

18:54.660 --> 18:55.561
Go back to your posts. Hurry!

18:55.831 --> 18:56.501
Yes.

19:06.571 --> 19:07.370
Are you crying?

19:09.481 --> 19:10.880
When did you get here?

19:11.110 --> 19:11.940
- We've been here for a while. - We've been here a while.

19:12.011 --> 19:13.110
We've been standing here for a while, Instructor.

19:15.281 --> 19:16.180
Do you feel touched?

19:17.120 --> 19:18.221
You even kept a copy.

19:19.021 --> 19:20.450
I have to save it.

19:20.751 --> 19:21.850
I'll save it until I die.

19:28.231 --> 19:29.001
That's enough. You can go back.

19:29.061 --> 19:29.731
Hurry up.

19:29.801 --> 19:31.501
I'll stay here and have some peace and quiet.

19:32.031 --> 19:33.731
- We'll feel moved together. - We'll feel moved together.

19:33.801 --> 19:34.731
Let's feel moved together.

19:35.031 --> 19:35.940
This kind of video...

19:36.370 --> 19:37.440
- Let's watch it again. - Let's watch it again.

19:38.241 --> 19:38.900
Jiang Yu!

19:39.110 --> 19:40.311
- Jiang Yu. - Jiang Yu.

19:40.370 --> 19:41.041
Wake up.

19:41.110 --> 19:42.440
- Jiang Yu. - Jiang Yu.

19:42.511 --> 19:44.811
- Wake up! - Jiang Yu.

19:45.581 --> 19:47.751
- Jiang Yu. - Jiang Yu.

19:51.321 --> 19:52.751
Jiang Yu.

19:52.821 --> 19:54.620
I was so scared yesterday.

19:54.791 --> 19:55.450
Their line of work...

19:55.521 --> 19:56.491
is really dangerous.

19:56.561 --> 19:57.521
When other couples go on a date,

19:57.590 --> 19:58.690
they open a bottle of wine.

19:58.890 --> 20:00.660
It's not even easy for us to meet...

20:01.561 --> 20:02.700
and we open a bottle of iodine.

20:03.731 --> 20:05.130
- Other couples often meet and say, - Keep this.

20:05.771 --> 20:06.430
"Your button came off."

20:06.501 --> 20:07.501
"I'll sew it back on for you."

20:07.870 --> 20:09.100
For us,

20:09.640 --> 20:10.370
"Your flesh fell off."

20:10.440 --> 20:11.170
"I'll sew it back on for you."

20:11.241 --> 20:12.771
It's so scary.

20:13.771 --> 20:14.571
Dr. Xu.

20:15.940 --> 20:16.610
Here.

20:19.011 --> 20:21.180
Dr. Xu, let me ask you something.

20:21.511 --> 20:23.180
How can you be so calm?

20:23.751 --> 20:24.551
What do you mean?

20:24.781 --> 20:26.590
You're a firefighter's family.

20:26.650 --> 20:28.350
How can you not be anxious?

20:29.690 --> 20:30.620
I can't do it.

20:31.390 --> 20:32.890
Will you get used to it after a while?

20:33.890 --> 20:35.031
I can't get used to it either.

20:35.261 --> 20:36.200
What should you do then?

20:37.261 --> 20:38.160
There's nothing we can do.

20:38.231 --> 20:39.200
There's nothing we can do?

20:39.501 --> 20:41.001
Then what should we do?

20:41.071 --> 20:41.731
What should we do?

20:41.801 --> 20:42.600
I don't know.

20:44.501 --> 20:45.541
(Rapid report reception, precise dispatch, scientific direction)

20:46.471 --> 20:47.271
Hello, 119.

20:47.340 --> 20:48.011
Go ahead.

20:50.041 --> 20:50.711
Let's go.

20:55.380 --> 20:57.420
(China Fire and Rescue)

21:03.461 --> 21:04.390
Attention, Shilitai.

21:04.461 --> 21:06.090
There has been a cyanide leak at an electroplating plant.

21:06.261 --> 21:07.231
Three workers have already been poisoned.

21:07.291 --> 21:09.561
60mg of hydrogen cyanide gas is enough to kill.

21:09.831 --> 21:11.731
Everyone must take precautions and decontaminate...

21:11.801 --> 21:12.801
to prevent the gas from spreading.

21:13.031 --> 21:13.700
Copy that.

21:26.380 --> 21:27.511
Get a blood cyanide level test...

21:27.581 --> 21:28.450
and alveolar-arterial gradient.

21:28.511 --> 21:29.350
Call Respiratory for a consult.

21:29.420 --> 21:30.521
- Hurry. - Yes.

21:45.660 --> 21:47.430
(Mild hazard area)

21:48.001 --> 21:48.870
Pi Pi, hurry.

21:48.930 --> 21:49.900
Set up the decontamination channel here.

21:49.971 --> 21:50.640
Okay.

21:53.870 --> 21:54.711
Hurry up, Pi Pi.

21:54.771 --> 21:55.471
How much longer?

21:55.541 --> 21:56.311
Almost done.

21:56.380 --> 21:57.041
Hurry.

21:57.110 --> 21:58.410
No one is trapped inside.

21:58.481 --> 21:59.950
The three workers who were poisoned at the scene...

22:00.011 --> 22:00.811
have been sent to the hospital.

22:01.011 --> 22:01.711
Do you have the blueprint?

22:03.221 --> 22:03.981
During normal operations,

22:04.051 --> 22:05.521
the workers should open this burst valve.

22:05.581 --> 22:06.390
But they made a mistake later on...

22:06.450 --> 22:07.551
and opened the valve for the acid pipe...

22:07.620 --> 22:08.350
which caused a huge amount...

22:08.420 --> 22:09.890
of acidic substance and cyanide liquid...

22:09.991 --> 22:11.090
to form hydrocyanic acid.

22:11.620 --> 22:12.491
Eventually, it vaporized into a large amount...

22:12.561 --> 22:13.890
of the poisonous gas, hydrogen cyanide.

22:14.231 --> 22:15.461
What's the volume of the wastewater tank?

22:15.590 --> 22:16.400
Twenty-five tons.

22:16.600 --> 22:17.331
That much?

22:17.461 --> 22:18.700
Isn't the gas chamber inside?

22:19.031 --> 22:20.870
Yes, 60mg is enough to kill a person.

22:21.231 --> 22:22.271
There are 25 tons...

22:22.331 --> 22:23.140
of cyanide wastewater now.

22:23.440 --> 22:24.271
If it overflows completely,

22:24.340 --> 22:26.041
it'll produce 10,000g of hydrogen cyanide.

22:26.541 --> 22:27.771
If the concentration reaches...

22:27.840 --> 22:29.340
300m per cubic meter,

22:29.481 --> 22:30.610
it will cause death, similar to electrocution.

22:34.880 --> 22:35.610
Jiang Yi.

22:36.021 --> 22:37.150
What's the progress?

22:37.521 --> 22:38.420
Chief.

22:38.581 --> 22:40.420
The decontamination camp has been set up.

22:41.021 --> 22:41.721
Let's go.

22:42.150 --> 22:43.120
Jun Ping, gear up.

22:43.190 --> 22:43.860
Yes.

22:57.170 --> 22:57.840
Chief.

22:58.071 --> 22:59.241
The detection robot is in position.

22:59.311 --> 23:00.541
You can go in now.

23:01.471 --> 23:02.140
Copy that.

24:16.781 --> 24:17.450
Be careful.

24:46.251 --> 24:46.910
Chief.

24:47.281 --> 24:48.551
If you turn right at the wastewater adjustment pool,

24:48.680 --> 24:50.221
you'll see the acid wastewater valve.

24:54.590 --> 24:56.120
The concentration has already reached its limit.

24:56.190 --> 24:56.860
You have to hurry.

25:03.630 --> 25:04.731
(Acid wastewater)

25:09.640 --> 25:10.301
Chief.

25:10.501 --> 25:11.670
That's the burst valve on the side.

25:17.541 --> 25:19.211
(Burst channel)

25:57.221 --> 25:59.150
Chief, the index is dropping.

25:59.221 --> 26:00.751
You can get out now.

26:18.640 --> 26:19.301
Be careful.

26:21.910 --> 26:23.140
- Chief. - Chief.

26:23.211 --> 26:23.940
- Yang Chi. - Are you okay?

26:24.011 --> 26:24.741
I'm fine.

26:25.311 --> 26:26.180
I'm okay.

26:26.711 --> 26:28.781
Flange gate valve leak. Get the wrench.

26:28.850 --> 26:29.521
Okay.

26:38.561 --> 26:39.420
Chief, the wrench.

26:40.160 --> 26:40.930
Hold the light for me.

26:40.991 --> 26:41.660
Okay.

27:13.430 --> 27:14.590
We weren't able to save any of them.

27:15.430 --> 27:17.130
Cyanide is the king of all poisons.

27:17.200 --> 27:18.430
Once you get it in you,

27:18.501 --> 27:20.001
you're basically dead.

27:22.271 --> 27:23.640
Everyone, put on your masks.

27:23.801 --> 27:24.840
Chief is out.

27:25.870 --> 27:26.910
Prepare for decontamination.

27:57.700 --> 28:03.110
(Public)

28:12.251 --> 28:13.321
(Yancheng Firefighter)

28:30.741 --> 28:31.571
Good job, Yang Chi.

29:27.090 --> 29:32.200
(Decontamination area)

29:46.781 --> 29:47.680
Chief!

29:47.910 --> 29:48.680
Chief.

29:52.021 --> 29:52.751
Chief.

29:53.021 --> 29:53.751
Chief.

29:53.991 --> 29:54.920
Doctor!

29:55.390 --> 29:56.420
Doctor!

30:01.590 --> 30:02.590
Doctor!

30:03.630 --> 30:04.801
Doctor.

30:04.930 --> 30:06.400
Hurry up.

30:07.400 --> 30:08.231
Come on.

30:10.301 --> 30:11.170
Chief.

30:11.571 --> 30:12.471
Chief!

30:21.610 --> 30:23.350
Dr. Xu.

30:23.581 --> 30:24.581
Another patient with cyanide poisoning...

30:24.650 --> 30:25.380
has been brought in.

30:25.450 --> 30:27.221
Dr. Xu opened a green examination channel.

30:28.551 --> 30:30.021
You may go after getting the medicine.

30:31.660 --> 30:32.321
No.

30:32.390 --> 30:33.590
Why is it cyanide poisoning again?

30:33.660 --> 30:34.761
It's the same electroplating factory.

30:34.831 --> 30:35.961
The firefighter who went to rescue him...

30:36.061 --> 30:37.130
is also poisoned.

31:04.420 --> 31:05.090
Give him oxygen.

31:21.340 --> 31:22.440
Dr. Xu, ventricular fibrillation.

31:23.680 --> 31:24.481
Defibrillator.

31:25.110 --> 31:26.511
Epinephrine, 1mg IV push.

31:30.120 --> 31:31.350
200J, going once.

31:32.680 --> 31:33.350
Clear.

31:50.670 --> 31:51.541
200J, going twice.

31:54.370 --> 31:57.840
(Charging to 200J)

31:57.981 --> 31:58.910
Ready.

31:59.340 --> 32:00.011
Clear.

32:04.450 --> 32:05.721
200J, going thrice.

32:08.150 --> 32:08.821
Clear.

32:32.541 --> 32:33.811
Dr. Xu, the sinus rhythm is back.

32:49.590 --> 32:50.400
Dr. Xu.

32:50.561 --> 32:52.731
I'll prepare to get the blood cyanide level...

32:52.801 --> 32:54.130
and arterial blood gas analysis.

32:55.900 --> 32:56.670
Xi Xi, get ready.

33:50.190 --> 33:51.461
The test results are out.

33:51.821 --> 33:53.190
The blood cyanide level is normal.

33:53.430 --> 33:54.890
The arterial blood gas level is normal.

33:55.291 --> 33:56.561
If everything is normal after observation,

33:56.900 --> 33:58.001
you may go.

33:59.700 --> 34:00.430
Look.

34:01.100 --> 34:02.100
I'm fine.

34:03.001 --> 34:04.100
Don't worry.

34:05.170 --> 34:06.640
Of course I know you're fine.

34:08.071 --> 34:09.370
That's hydrogen cyanide.

34:09.440 --> 34:10.481
If you weren't fine,

34:11.610 --> 34:12.811
you wouldn't be lying here.

34:21.120 --> 34:22.120
Who said,

34:22.820 --> 34:24.120
"I'm still recovering."

34:25.260 --> 34:26.421
"I don't have to go to the front line"?

34:29.631 --> 34:30.760
Who said,

34:31.800 --> 34:32.631
"I'll be careful."

34:34.131 --> 34:35.131
"I'll be fine"?

34:35.870 --> 34:36.640
Xu Qin.

34:37.740 --> 34:38.401
I'm sorry.

34:39.870 --> 34:41.470
I didn't mean to hide it from you.

34:41.740 --> 34:43.711
I don't want you to apologize.

34:43.841 --> 34:45.111
You didn't fail me.

34:45.180 --> 34:46.850
I don't care if you hide it from me or not.

34:46.910 --> 34:48.350
I just want you to be safe.

34:57.890 --> 34:58.820
Song Yan.

35:02.260 --> 35:03.300
Have you thought...

35:06.831 --> 35:07.901
about changing your job?

35:15.240 --> 35:16.041
Forget it.

35:16.171 --> 35:17.211
I'm working now.

35:17.280 --> 35:18.081
Let's talk at home.

35:23.680 --> 35:24.450
Song Yan.

35:29.450 --> 35:30.421
I am...

35:32.760 --> 35:33.990
not noble at all.

35:35.890 --> 35:37.401
I don't understand the greater good.

35:39.831 --> 35:41.401
I'm just a selfish person.

35:47.570 --> 35:49.510
I don't want you to be a hero.

35:51.611 --> 35:52.680
Why should you?

35:55.280 --> 35:56.611
Why?

36:25.581 --> 36:26.611
Today, Xu Qin...

36:26.881 --> 36:28.981
really risked her life for Chief.

36:29.780 --> 36:30.481
Yes.

36:30.550 --> 36:32.780
Now I know why Chief likes Dr. Xu.

36:33.180 --> 36:34.151
She's not an ordinary woman.

36:34.751 --> 36:35.421
That's right.

36:36.220 --> 36:37.061
Think about it.

36:37.361 --> 36:38.620
To be a firefighter's wife,

36:38.691 --> 36:40.160
one must be really strong.

36:41.361 --> 36:42.061
Let me tell you.

36:42.791 --> 36:44.100
I just got a girlfriend, right?

36:44.430 --> 36:46.331
Her family doesn't approve of my job.

36:46.831 --> 36:48.030
Coincidentally,

36:48.100 --> 36:49.030
she saw everything today.

36:49.100 --> 36:49.930
What should I...

36:50.501 --> 36:51.401
I understand too.

36:51.470 --> 36:53.300
Why does she have to live in fear with me?

36:53.541 --> 36:54.470
That's right.

36:54.671 --> 36:55.640
If I had a girlfriend,

36:55.941 --> 36:56.780
I wouldn't have the heart to let her feel scared too.

36:57.711 --> 36:58.881
Then you and Ms. Nan...

37:01.481 --> 37:02.410
Forget it.

37:02.981 --> 37:04.820
What's the use if it's just one-sided on my part?

37:05.450 --> 37:06.751
Besides, after today,

37:07.151 --> 37:08.151
I can understand her too.

37:08.350 --> 37:09.151
No.

37:09.350 --> 37:10.990
That wouldn't be her reason.

37:11.291 --> 37:12.061
Then why?

37:12.291 --> 37:13.961
She's older than you.

37:15.490 --> 37:16.691
In this day and age,

37:16.760 --> 37:17.600
height isn't an obstacle.

37:17.660 --> 37:18.660
Age isn't a problem.

37:19.231 --> 37:20.570
Then tell her.

37:20.631 --> 37:21.600
Why are you telling us?

37:21.671 --> 37:22.970
That's right. Tell her.

37:23.030 --> 37:23.700
That's right.

37:24.341 --> 37:25.240
What?

37:25.370 --> 37:26.070
"What?"

37:26.541 --> 37:27.341
Look at you.

37:34.111 --> 37:34.910
I'll tell her.

37:36.550 --> 37:37.921
Go, I'll approve your leave now.

37:37.981 --> 37:38.981
It's okay. Maybe she's still at work.

37:39.050 --> 37:39.780
Go on.

37:40.620 --> 37:41.291
Go.

37:41.350 --> 37:42.791
He's scared. He wouldn't go.

37:42.850 --> 37:43.760
I'll stretch for a while.

37:44.021 --> 37:44.820
Go ahead.

37:44.961 --> 37:46.390
Warm up before you go.

37:51.501 --> 37:53.100
I was so scared.

37:53.600 --> 37:54.271
Touch my heart.

37:54.331 --> 37:55.930
It's still beating fast.

37:57.470 --> 37:58.401
Stop crying.

37:58.470 --> 37:59.841
You're an ER nurse.

37:59.901 --> 38:01.740
How can you be so weak?

38:03.640 --> 38:05.680
If something like this happened to your boyfriend,

38:05.740 --> 38:07.211
what would you do?

38:09.010 --> 38:10.010
Coincidentally,

38:10.220 --> 38:12.350
I saw what happened last night.

38:12.720 --> 38:14.720
If I hadn't seen it,

38:15.151 --> 38:15.890
I wouldn't know...

38:15.950 --> 38:17.990
if something worse had happened.

38:19.760 --> 38:21.631
How could I not be surprised?

38:21.890 --> 38:22.691
That's enough.

38:22.791 --> 38:24.861
They've been training for a long time.

38:24.930 --> 38:26.831
They're very skilled.

38:27.131 --> 38:28.430
In this line of work,

38:28.501 --> 38:30.271
danger is inevitable.

38:31.341 --> 38:32.140
Yes.

38:32.541 --> 38:33.370
I know...

38:33.441 --> 38:34.841
that his job was dangerous before.

38:35.271 --> 38:36.211
Back then, I didn't know...

38:36.271 --> 38:37.510
that it was this dangerous.

38:37.780 --> 38:39.211
All right, stop crying.

38:39.711 --> 38:40.811
Come on, let's get to work.

38:40.881 --> 38:41.910
All right, let's go.

38:43.151 --> 38:44.921
How can I not be scared?

38:44.981 --> 38:46.450
Every time we meet,

38:46.720 --> 38:49.720
it might be the last time.

38:50.361 --> 38:51.120
I know.

38:51.191 --> 38:52.620
Stop crying.

39:08.541 --> 39:09.271
Did you...

39:09.970 --> 39:11.140
see Qin Qin today?

39:15.311 --> 39:16.350
She must be heartbroken for you.

39:24.390 --> 39:25.390
Did anything happen...

39:26.260 --> 39:27.561
between you two?

39:35.331 --> 39:36.131
Here's the soup.

39:38.100 --> 39:38.941
My child.

39:39.771 --> 39:40.941
Why do you look...

39:41.311 --> 39:42.711
so troubled?

39:43.510 --> 39:45.341
Talk to us.

39:45.711 --> 39:47.510
See if we can help you.

39:51.780 --> 39:53.180
I feel so useless.

40:01.627 --> 40:02.426
Yan Er.

40:03.627 --> 40:04.596
I know...

40:05.426 --> 40:06.596
you like Qin Qin.

40:06.737 --> 40:07.536
I can also tell...

40:07.596 --> 40:09.266
that Qin Qin really likes you.

40:11.107 --> 40:12.266
We're just worried...

40:12.866 --> 40:14.477
that after being together for so long,

40:14.536 --> 40:15.477
you'll find that you're incompatible.

40:16.377 --> 40:17.176
Think about it.

40:17.406 --> 40:19.507
Actually, your mom had a good life back then.

40:19.877 --> 40:21.477
But your dad got into trouble,

40:21.547 --> 40:23.016
so she divorced your dad.

40:23.216 --> 40:24.716
Even if she ended up like that,

40:24.786 --> 40:25.716
she wouldn't come back...

40:25.786 --> 40:26.987
to live a normal life.

40:27.286 --> 40:29.216
- Besides... - Xu Qin is different from her.

40:33.556 --> 40:34.656
Don't mention her anymore.

40:41.837 --> 40:42.766
She's getting off work.

40:43.437 --> 40:44.237
I'll pick her up.

40:44.966 --> 40:45.667
Go.

40:56.346 --> 40:57.647
How many times have I told you?

40:57.716 --> 40:59.716
Don't mention that person in front of him.

41:00.257 --> 41:01.317
I just think...

41:01.386 --> 41:02.817
that he's all grown up.

41:02.886 --> 41:03.786
Even if he's old,

41:03.857 --> 41:05.386
the wound is still there.

41:05.886 --> 41:07.727
Look at him. Does he look like he has recovered?

41:09.027 --> 41:09.826
Also,

41:10.397 --> 41:13.667
why are you comparing Qin Qin to that woman?

41:14.096 --> 41:15.667
Do you think they don't have enough troubles on their own?

41:15.737 --> 41:16.866
All right. I know.

41:16.937 --> 41:18.036
I misspoke.

41:18.866 --> 41:20.007
I'm just worried, okay?

41:20.076 --> 41:21.536
All right, from now on, stop.

41:21.877 --> 41:23.207
Let's wait for him to pick her up...

41:23.277 --> 41:24.406
and see what he says.

41:25.306 --> 41:26.147
Let's eat.

41:27.147 --> 41:28.346
I made shrimp especially for you.

